Note on data: This repository contains code only. All financial data used
by FinSight360 is retrieved at runtime from the SEC EDGAR public API
(https://www.sec.gov/developer) and is in the public domain. The reference
data files in data/reference/ (auditor mappings and corporate relationships)
are illustrative examples created for this project and do not represent
verified or current real-world relationships.

Note on AI components: The LangChain RAG pipeline and LLM risk narratives
generated by FinSight360 are for informational and research purposes only.
They do not constitute financial advice, investment recommendations, or
legal opinions. All outputs should be reviewed by qualified professionals
before being used in any decision-making context.
